 This program uses MOD01 to fit PiN partial-waves
 To see details enter "GO50" anytime
 Enter 1(Pi-N), 2(K-N,K-D), or 3(K-N,K*N) -> Masses set for Pi-N with Pi-Delta inelastic
 7/29/26
 RETURN for non-graphics
 "TDL" to set PLOT time delay
 or enter TERMINAL type (XW, TK41, or ?) -> To get Instructions for using MODEL enter "?"
 In NORMAL mode data is entered as:
 XY NXY Xs Ys Errs which is then repeated
 In COLUMN mode data is entered as XY followed by X Y Err
 which is repeated until RETURN goes back to XY
 NMODE= 1 (1=NORMAL, -1=COLUMN)  Enter choice -> PICT file is ON

 To reverse a CUT(eg piDelta) add D, R, N to the PHASE
 (eg S11D would be S11 with piDelta reversed)
