 enter "GO25" here. Change Ps? -> Special CONTOUR plot, Cursor keystrokes will:
 E- Plot VPI single energy amplitudes
 R- Locate nearby 1st sheet pole- Write to file 7
 Y- Locate nearby 2nd sheet pole- Write to file 7
 Z- Locate nearby zero- Write to file 7
 B- Begin anew with this prompt
 C- Clear and Redraw plot
 D- Draw Delta branch point
 I(or Q)- Return to SINIT prompt
 K(M)- Plot Karlsruhe(or CMB) amplitudes
 A- Change Namp
 L- Enter contour Levels
 H- Plot Particle Data Book Resonances
 F,Int- Plot Poles for soln(Int), Int=0 for ALL solns
 G,Int- Plot Zeroes as for F,Int
 W- Toggles ERRORS on pole positions
 S,Int- Reverse "cut" for sheet Int(1=piD, 2=rhoN, 3=etaN)
